Scoped fillborders video filter

The option table, the border checks and chroma border shifts of config_input,
the CCIR fill colours and the gbrp rgba map, and the smear, mirror, fixed,
reflect, wrap, fade (lerp8) and margins loops in src/video-fillborders.ts and
src/video-ops/fillborders.ts follow libavfilter/vf_fillborders.c
(smear_borders8, mirror_borders8, fixed_borders8, reflect_borders8,
wrap_borders8, lerp8, fade_borders8, margins_borders8, config_input,
fillborders_options, pix_fmts), libavutil/colorspace.h (RGB_TO_Y_CCIR,
RGB_TO_U_CCIR, RGB_TO_V_CCIR), libavutil/parseutils.c (av_parse_color) and
libavfilter/drawutils.c (fill_map, ff_fill_rgba_map).
